annotations:
  artifacthub.io/changes: |-
    - kind: changed
      description: "Updated the edge image to v4.10.1, which exports response status codes and latency by cache layer. New metrics imageengine_edge_responses_total, imageengine_edge_response_duration_seconds, and imageengine_edge_internal_duration_seconds cover every response, including prechecks and admission rejections. The internal duration subtracts origin fetch time so a slow origin does not look like the cluster falling behind."
